  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The 3004 5V Slim Micro Fan can be combined with 3D printing models to achieve various functions, such as mini humidifiers, purifiers, etc. Compared with the same size DC Fan, 3004 5V Slim Micro Fan has a higher air pressure, more suitable for cooling and other application scenarios."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Before use, please make sure the supply voltage meets the use of the product range and the voltage is stable. Line-powered load exceeds the maximum power consumption of this product 120%."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "During operation, avoid blocking the blades of the fan."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid carrying the fan by holding the lead wires. The bearings and the lead wires may become damaged. Additionally, static electricity may damage the internal circuits of the fan."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid using the fan in environments of corrosive gas or liquid."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Do not store the fan in environments with high humidity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid storing the fan for over 6 months. For long term storage, please connect power to the fan shortly every 6 months even though the fan is stored at room temperature."
    }
  ],
